  "description": "High-throughput streaming XLSX and CSV import/export for LightExcel WPF (.NET 8/9/10/11+ Windows, AnyCPU; zero-DOM XmlWriter XLSX & block-buffered CSV, 10M cells exported in ~2s). Export raw records or the current filtered/sorted view, preserve multilevel XLSX headers and data-cell merges (including 2D grid & computed merge results). Includes LightExcel.Core as a dependency. 问题反馈/联系邮箱: 2285161881@qq.com",
